---
const title = "¿Tienes una idea? Hablemos.".split(" ");
---
<section id="contacto" class="px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
  <div data-reveal class="mesh mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-[2.5rem] px-6 py-16 text-center md:px-14 md:py-24">
    <div class="mesh-blob -right-20 -top-28 h-[26rem] w-[26rem] bg-lemon/90"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob -bottom-32 -left-20 h-[30rem] w-[30rem] bg-sonic/70 [animation-delay:-8s]"></div>
    <div class="mesh-blob left-1/3 top-1/4 h-[22rem] w-[22rem] bg-sea [animation-delay:-14s]"></div>

    <p class="mb-4 font-semibold text-ink/70">06 — Contacto</p>
    <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-5xl font-extrabold leading-[0.95] tracking-tight md:text-7xl">
      {title.map((w) => <><span class="word">{w}</span>{" "}</>)}
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-ink/75">
      Un proyecto, una web que se ha quedado vieja o ganas de aprender a programar. Escríbeme y lo vemos.
    </p>

    <a href="mailto:issamaymoutt17@gmail.com" class="mt-10 inline-block break-all rounded-full bg-ink px-8 py-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-sonic md:text-2xl">
      issamaymoutt17@gmail.com
    </a>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="tel:+34614643824" class="btn-light">☎ +34 614 643 824</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/issa-maymoutt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-light">
        <img src="/icons/linkedin.svg" alt="" class="h-5 w-5" /> LinkedIn
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/aissa-m" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-light">
        <img src="/icons/github.svg" alt="" class="h-5 w-5" /> GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
